# Opinion

Meeting: 0002-start-building-the-app-using-the-agentic-workflows
Agent: Critic
Task: start building the app using the agentic workflows
Context:
- Multiple agents will touch meeting files; risk of overwriting prior opinions or skipping validation.
- Backend lacks persistence strategy and recurrence exceptions; DSL growth could outpace tests.
Position:
- Guard against configuration drift (teamconfig, AGENTS instructions) and untracked meeting ids.
- Watch for hidden dependencies or shortcuts that erode the transport-agnostic goal.
Recommendations:
- Enforce meeting creation via CLI only; avoid manual folder edits that could bypass validation.
- Require tests for every new DSL branch and participant path; flag any untested exceptions.
- Keep opinion files append-only per meeting; create new meetings for significant tasks to preserve history.
